Hello All,

The Printer Working Group and OpenPrinting joint virtual face-to-face event
will be held Tuesday-Thursday, May 16-18 2023.

Since this is a virtual event, all sessions will be held via WebEx.   The e=
vent
page <https://pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/may-2023-virtual.html> has the
current agenda as well as the teleconference information.  Any and all
interested parties are welcome to attend.  If you have any questions,
please feel free to reach out.

We hope to see everyone there!

Thanks!
Jeremy

